@ContentService_HostAddress = http://localhost:7450
@timestamp = {{$timestamp}}

###
### ANALYSIS CONTENT TEST SCENARIOS (001-006)
###
### Same provider combinations as customer-content scenarios
### Processes multiple customer content items together with composite video output
###
### Provider Registry (SubscriptionScopeRegistry):
### ┌──────────────┬───────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────┐
### │ ScopeKey     │ Outline       │ Audio        │ Video        │
### ├──────────────┼───────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────┤
### │ scenario-001 │ outline-fast  │ audio-quick  │ queue-ext    │
### │ scenario-002 │ outline-fast  │ audio-hq     │ queue-ext    │
### │ scenario-003 │ outline-queue │ audio-quick  │ queue-ext    │
### │ scenario-004 │ outline-queue │ audio-hq     │ queue-ext    │
### │ scenario-005 │ outline-fast  │ [none]       │ queue-int    │
### │ scenario-006 │ outline-queue │ [none]       │ queue-int    │
### └──────────────┴───────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────┘
###
### RECOMMENDED: Use the "from-scope" endpoint (auto-fetches latest N successful CustomerContents)
### FALLBACK: Use the manual endpoint if you need to specify exact CustomerContent IDs
###

###
### SCENARIO 001: Fast outline + Quick audio + External video
### Providers: outline-fast (5s) → audio-quick (3s) → video-queue-external (30s polling)
### Expected: ~38 seconds per item
###
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/api/content-service/v1/commercial/tests/analysis-contents-from-scope
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-001-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-001",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "Title": "Analysis Scenario 001 - Fast Outline + Quick Audio + External Video",
  "MaxCustomerContents": 5
}

###
### SCENARIO 002: Fast outline + HQ audio (polling) + External video
### Providers: outline-fast (5s) → audio-hq (20s polling) → video-queue-external (30s polling)
### Expected: ~53 seconds per item
###
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/api/content-service/v1/commercial/tests/analysis-contents-from-scope
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-002-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-002",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "Title": "Analysis Scenario 002 - Fast Outline + HQ Audio + External Video",
  "MaxCustomerContents": 5
}

###
### SCENARIO 003: Queue outline (polling) + Quick audio + External video
### Providers: outline-queue (10s polling) → audio-quick (3s) → video-queue-external (30s polling)
### Expected: ~43 seconds per item
###
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/api/content-service/v1/commercial/tests/analysis-contents-from-scope
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-003-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-003",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "Title": "Analysis Scenario 003 - Queue Outline + Quick Audio + External Video",
  "MaxCustomerContents": 5
}

###
### SCENARIO 004: Queue outline (polling) + HQ audio (polling) + External video
### Providers: outline-queue (10s polling) → audio-hq (20s polling) → video-queue-external (30s polling)
### Expected: ~58 seconds per item (maximum complexity)
###
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/api/content-service/v1/commercial/tests/analysis-contents-from-scope
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-004-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-004",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "Title": "Analysis Scenario 004 - Queue Outline + HQ Audio + External Video",
  "MaxCustomerContents": 5
}

###
### SCENARIO 005: Fast outline + Internal video (generates audio internally)
### Providers: outline-fast (5s) → video-queue-internal (30s polling, creates own audio)
### Expected: ~35 seconds per item
###
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/api/content-service/v1/commercial/tests/analysis-contents-from-scope
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-005-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-005",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "Title": "Analysis Scenario 005 - Fast Outline + Internal Video",
  "MaxCustomerContents": 5
}

###
### SCENARIO 006: Queue outline (polling) + Internal video (generates audio internally)
### Providers: outline-queue (10s polling) → video-queue-internal (30s polling, creates own audio)
### Expected: ~40 seconds per item
###
POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/api/content-service/v1/commercial/tests/analysis-contents-from-scope
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: scenario-006-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "ScopeKey": "scenario-006",
  "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
  "Title": "Analysis Scenario 006 - Queue Outline + Internal Video",
  "MaxCustomerContents": 5
}

