### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LEGACY: Manual Analysis Content with explicit CustomerContent IDs
### Use this if you need precise control over which items to include
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

###
### Manual: Specify exact CustomerContent IDs
### (Use: /analysis-contents endpoint instead of /analysis-contents-from-scope)
###
### POST {{ContentService_HostAddress}}/api/content-service/v1/commercial/tests/analysis-contents
### Content-Type: application/json
### X-Correlation-Id: manual-scenario-{{$timestamp}}
###
### {
###   "ScopeKey": "scenario-001",
###   "DomainName": "https://scenario.com",
###   "Title": "Manual Analysis with Specific IDs",
###   "CustomerContentIds": [
###     "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
###     "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
###     "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"
###   ]
### }
